    "title": "Order of Operations (BODMAS)",
    "standard": {
        "explanation": "<h3>Rules of Math</h3><p>When you have many operations, use <strong>BODMAS</strong> to know what to do first.</p><ul><li><strong>B</strong>rackets ()</li><li><strong>O</strong>rders (Powers/Roots)</li><li><strong>D</strong>ivision / <strong>M</strong>ultiplication (Left to right)</li><li><strong>A</strong>ddition / <strong>S</strong>ubtraction (Left to right)</li></ul><p>Example: 2 + 3 x 4</p><p>Multiply first: 3 x 4 = 12. Then add 2: Total = 14.</p><div class='interactive-block'><h4>Try It!</h4><p>Calculate 5 + 2 x 3</p><input type='text' class='form-control' placeholder='Answer'><button class='btn btn-sm btn-primary try-it-btn' data-answer='11'>Check</button><div class='feedback'></div></div>",
