        "explanation": "<h3>Who goes first?</h3><p>Imagine a VIP line.</p><ol><li><strong>(Brackets)</strong> are VIPs. Do them first!</li><li><strong>x and /</strong> are next in line.</li><li><strong>+ and -</strong> are last.</li></ol><p>So for 2 + 5 x 2, the multiply goes before the plus!</p>",
